 and refer more  friends and family because they know  when they like you so it's a great way  to start building relationships with  customers so as much as possible you can  try to follow your customers the next  thing that I'd like to use clear for is  to share content that I find interesting  and exciting so I read a lot of books  and blogs and articles and they'll often  post on my twitter feed information that  I find interesting that's helped me grow  my business or inspirational quotes from  famous entrepreneurs that helped me you  know stay motivated want to continue to  drive my business forward and that's all  value I'd content that's not necessarily  promoting anything on my site it's just  trying to add value to my readers so  things that I find interesting and then  people will start to follow you and you  get known as an expert for whatever Gary  a drink so everything and I post is  usually around entrepreneurship so  whatever industry you're in try to  become the expert by posting interesting  and relevant content on your twitter  feed it could be links to content that  you've created but it could also be just  other content that you find really  interesting and you think your readers  would benefit from let in the last part  is we do have some emotional stuff that  will put on our twitter feed is a  contest we're promoting or new blog post  we put out that we really want to get  some attention to and that's okay to  have some promotional content in there  you have coupons or contest going on i  try to keep the ratio lo so try to add a  lot of value and try to connect with  your customers as much as possible and  then every now and then when you have  important contracts or promotions that  really want to get out there you have a  following if all you're doing is  blasting out promo offers people aren't  really going to follow you and pay  attention you just kind of screaming ads  at them so you want to add value build a  relationship and then when you do have  marketing messages they're much more  likely to want to pay attention to it  and find value in it so I hope that  helps if you have any other specific  questions let me know it would be happy  to walk you through  bit more for anybody who liked the video  please give it a thumbs up if you do  I'll create more just like it and it  also love to hear your thoughts and  feedback if you want to leave a comment  below and stay tuned for the next  episode  you  you
 

